Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:31.25,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}GOOD MORNING  崭新的一天你看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:31.25,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}GOOD-MORNING　新しい一日がほら
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:33.97,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}{\3c&H3999F3&}睁开眼睛  {\t(1300,1500,\3c&HE199FD&)}大声说出
