Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.67,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}准备开始
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.67,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}始まろうとしてる
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:41.47,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}我们要去哪？  我们该做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:41.47,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}どこへ行こうか？　何しようか？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:45.01,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}真是令人兴奋不已的  GOOD MORNING
