Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.01,1:18:58.14,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}非常感谢大家！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.62,1:18:58.45,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}非常感谢大家！
