Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.62,1:28:58.49,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}让我们开始启程
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.62,1:28:58.49,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}始まってゆく
