Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.84,1:29:07.44,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}就这么奔赴前去
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.84,1:29:07.44,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}駆け出してゆく
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.44,1:29:13.46,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}怀着崭新又未曾知晓的希望
