Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.09,1:29:17.56,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}不论要去向何方
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.09,1:29:17.56,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}どんな行き先でも
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.09,1:29:17.56,注音 - iori,,0,0,0,,{\pos(941,940)\fad(120,100)\blur5}ゆ
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.86,1:29:22.44,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}总会有喜悦与悲伤相伴
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.86,1:29:22.44,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}喜びと悲しみは廻る
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.86,1:29:22.44,注音 - iori,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1088,940)\fad(120,100)\blur5}めぐ
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.44,1:29:26.93,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}不论多么艰辛也要继续前行
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.44,1:29:26.93,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}辛くても進んでゆけるのは
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.08,1:29:32.20,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}因为珍贵的梦想在等待
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.08,1:29:32.20,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}大切な夢があるから
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.05,1:29:37.46,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Start  这首  My Life Song
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.05,1:29:37.46,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Start　この　My Life Song
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.73,1:29:41.11,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}就让我的歌声
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.73,1:29:41.11,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}私の歌声で
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.64,1:29:43.51,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一路响彻四方
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.64,1:29:43.51,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}どこまでも響け
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.51,1:29:46.66,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Feel  顺从这份感受
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.51,1:29:46.66,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Feel　感じるまま
