Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.89,1:29:50.34,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}好きなメロディーでいい
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.73,1:29:52.67,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}所谓心声便是如此
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.73,1:29:52.67,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}それを心と呼ぼう
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.67,1:29:55.92,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Stay  这首  My Love Song
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.67,1:29:55.92,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Stay　この　My Love Song
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.19,1:29:59.58,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}为我鼓劲的人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.19,1:29:59.58,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}エールくれる人よ
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.09,1:30:01.90,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}将我的爱赠与你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.09,1:30:01.90,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}愛を込め贈ろう
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.90,1:30:05.13,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Shine  闪耀吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.90,1:30:05.13,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Shine　輝いて
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.13,1:30:08.44,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}祝你能变得幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.13,1:30:08.44,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}ねぇ幸せあれ
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.64,1:30:13.80,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}明日也定会如期而至
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.64,1:30:13.80,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}いま明日が生まれる
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.26,1:30:32.88,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}那些流逝而去的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.26,1:30:32.88,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}通り過ぎてく
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.14,1:30:38.61,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}万般景色全部铭记于心
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.14,1:30:38.61,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}色んな景色胸に刻もう
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.48,1:30:41.80,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}待到回首过往
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.48,1:30:41.80,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}振り返ってく
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.06,1:30:48.06,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}一路上又会留下怎样的足迹
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.06,1:30:48.06,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}どんな足跡が続いてるだろう
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.71,1:30:52.14,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}若遇上风儿喧嚣
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.71,1:30:52.14,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}風が舞い上がれば
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.46,1:30:56.81,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}总会有温柔与严厉相随
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.46,1:30:56.81,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}優しさと厳しさを運ぶ
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.01,1:31:01.45,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}瞧呀  它们陪伴在我心旁
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.01,1:31:01.45,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}それはほら心の傍にいる
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.69,1:31:06.92,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}正如我所珍爱的你一般
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.69,1:31:06.92,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}大切なあなたのようだね
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.77,1:31:12.09,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Stand  这首  My Live Song
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.77,1:31:12.09,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Stand　この　My Live Song
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.34,1:31:15.82,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}希望我的歌音
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.34,1:31:15.82,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}私の歌詞から
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.34,1:31:15.82,注音 - iori,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,940)\fad(120,100)\blur5}ことば
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.22,1:31:18.14,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}能够传达给你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.22,1:31:18.14,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}いつまでも届け
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.14,1:31:21.31,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Wish  一如所愿
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.14,1:31:21.31,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}Wish　願うまま
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.52,1:31:25.07,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}你能随意地回应就好
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.52,1:31:25.07,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\blur5}自由なコールでいい
