Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.55,1:38:08.43,iori - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}来迈出步伐吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.55,1:38:08.43,iori - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}さあ歩きだそう
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.80,1:38:11.47,yayoi - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}以自己的方式
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.80,1:38:11.47,yayoi - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}自分らしく
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.47,1:38:15.85,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}刻下今天的所走过足迹…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.47,1:38:15.85,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}今日を刻んでゆくから…
