Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.96,1:38:35.67,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}一日一日
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.67,1:38:41.78,both - cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}迈向崭新的时间…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.67,1:38:41.78,both - jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\fad(120,100)}新しい時間へ…
